; Copy these lines into your USER profile npmrc (not this repo).
; Windows:  %USERPROFILE%\.npmrc
; macOS/Linux: ~/.npmrc
;
; 1. Coderlook Git (Gitea) → Settings → Applications → Generate New Token
;    Scope: read:package (or package read permission for the owner org/user)
; 2. Paste the line below and replace YOUR_TOKEN with that token.
; 3. Do not commit tokens. Keep them only in your user npmrc.

//git.coderlook.com/api/packages/abetal/npm/:_authToken=YOUR_TOKEN
